\pard \b\fs36\cf1 Beam State Combo Box
\par \plain\fs24 
\par The states displayed are:
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \b Shutdown\plain\fs24 :\tab The Gun is Off
\par \b EHT Off\plain\fs24 :\tab The Gun is on (the filament is heated and the extractor voltage is on) but EHT is Off
\par \b Beam On\plain\fs24 :\tab The Gun is On and the EHT is On ready for operation
\par 
\par 
\par \pard\tx355 When clicked the drop down list displays currently available commands.
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 Commands are:
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \b Shutdown\plain\fs24 \tab Go to \b Shutdown\plain\fs24  state 
\par \b Beam On\plain\fs24 \tab Ramp up Filament current (if required)  then set EHT to the required value in \b EHT On\plain\fs24  state
\par \b EHT On\plain\fs24 \tab Ramp EHT to the required value in \b EHT On\plain\fs24  state
\par \b EHT Off\plain\fs24 \tab Switch off EHT and go to \b EHT Off\plain\fs24  state
\par 
\par \page
