\par \plain\fs24 The parameter \b Signal\plain\fs24  detrmines the proportions of \b Signal A\plain\fs24  and \b Signal B\plain\fs24  which are mixed together.
\par 
\par A value of 1.0 means that all of \b Signal A\plain\fs24  and none of \b Signal B\plain\fs24  is used.
\par 
